    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d217">

                <pb facs="0299" n="287" sameAs="frus:frus1942v01/pg287"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">701.6511/1250</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Swiss Legation to the
                            Department of State</hi><anchor n="4"
                        xml:id="d217-f1"/></head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum</hi></p>
                <p>Offering and warranting reciprocity the Italian Government would like to see the
                    departure of the staff of the Italian Embassy, including all dependents,
                    arranged under the following conditions: <list>
                        <label>1.)</label>
                        <item>Safe-conduct from an American to a European port.</item>
                        <label>2.)</label>
                        <item>Guarantees that the vessel bringing the staff back to Europe will not
                            be forced to call at an inimical port or stopped at sea by enemy
                            forces.</item>
                        <label>3.)</label>
                        <item>Illimited removal of personal belongings.</item>
                        <label>4.)</label>
                        <item>Exemption of control and search of any kind of the staff and the
                            dependents as well as the private belongings taken along.</item>
                        <label>5.)</label>
                        <item>Guarantees against seizure of such belongings.</item>
                    </list></p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1941-12-13">December 13,
                            1941</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d217-f1" n="4" type="source" xml:id="d217-f1-content">
                <p>Similar memorandum of the same date received from the Swiss Legation with respect
                    to German interests.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
